      "content": "i know you say that but it doesnt feel that way. it feels like they'd finally be able to breathe if i wasnt always so depressed and making everything so hard. like if i wasnt there, they could just... be happy without having to worry about me all the time. it’s like i'm just a constant cloud over them.",
